Package: db.tools
Title: Database Connection and Query Tools
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Tony", "Chemit", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           email = "dev@tchemit.fr",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0007-1802-5256", URL = "https://ultreia.io"))
Description: Provides reusable helpers for database workflows built on 'DBI'.
    Executes parameterized queries as 'data.table' objects, manages connections
    supplied by application code, and reads connection options and SQL files.
    Restores H2 SQL backups into temporary or persistent directories and supplies
    reusable connection providers through an optional JDBC driver.
License: LGPL-2.1
URL: https://ultreia-io.github.io/db.tools/,
    https://github.com/ultreia-io/db.tools
BugReports: https://github.com/ultreia-io/db.tools/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: data.table, DBI, yaml
Suggests: knitr, rmarkdown, RJDBC, RSQLite, testthat (>= 3.0.0), withr
VignetteBuilder: knitr
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
